    "description": {
      "value": "\n<p><em>“The first ritual was just the second time anyone agreed to do something on purpose.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Ritual Memory.</strong> During a Soma Break, you can lead your party in a 30-minute coalition ritual — a song, a meal, a story, a marking. Each willing creature who took part banks one reroll: before the next Soma Break they may reroll the lowest die on one attribute check or attack roll. Once used, or when the next Soma Break begins, it is spent.</p>\n<p><strong>Coalition Calm.</strong> While you are within 1 square of an ally, that ally rerolls the lowest die on checks against being frightened.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
